# Worktree responsibility

This checkout is the source of truth for neural-network fitting after Monte
Carlo label generation. Its active branch is `research/nn-latent-fourier`.

- Work here on regression backbones, training and evaluation, operator
  learning, encoder/decoder design, latent representations, Fourier/modal
  control, NN datasets and NN research reports.
- Treat branching Monte Carlo sampling and mathematical theory as an upstream
  producer owned by `../parabolab` on `local/mc-tuple-policy`.
- Do not change mechanisms, estimator laws, moment or integrability theory,
  rate/tuple-policy optimization, certificates, proofs or Lean results here.
- If NN work needs a new MC capability, define the required producer contract,
  implement and verify it in `../parabolab`, then update the consumer here in
  a separate change. Do not silently merge unrelated MC branch work into this
  branch.
